  "prefLabel": "En 1502.25 Shield wire crossing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1502.25 \"Shield wire crossing\" means a crossing involving the construction or modification of only OPGW or shield wire or both within an existing, licensed crossing, provided that the OPGW or shield wire or both are located above the conductors. This crossing definition shall include OPGW.\n\nSource. #13939, eff 4-26-24",
